<title>USA: Sara Lee to buy Grand Met's Brossard, FIDA.</title>
<headline>Sara Lee to buy Grand Met's Brossard, FIDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sara Lee Corp said on Friday its Sara Lee/DE unit planned to buy the Brossard bakery businesses in France and Italy from Grand Metropolitan Plc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>With revenues over $150 million, Brossard make and market a variety of cakes, pastries and biscuits, Sara Lee said. In France, Brossard has the number one position in both the ambient and frozen cakes and pastries markets, it said.</p>
</text>
